WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.402
This query partitions employees by department and orders salary descending.

00:00:05.402 --> 00:00:09.022
Rank restarts at one for each department.

00:00:09.022 --> 00:00:13.122
Run the query and notice the boundaries between departments.

00:00:13.122 --> 00:00:19.818
This is a common pattern for top earners, top products, or highest values within categories.
